        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9313, Rope Edge Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of this knob really shines through with the rope detailing on the edge. This knob is perfect for those who wish to have a little interesting detailing on their cabinet knobs without going overboard. This plain knob with the rope design has a 1-1/4 inch diameter. Made by RK International, it comes packaged with the mounting hardware. Available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse With Matching <a href=\"/products/round-rope-cabinet-knob-rose-rk-international-bp-7820\"><b>Rope Cabinet Knob Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9313 Plain Knob with Rope at Edge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CK-9313-finish.jpg?v=1704354556\" width=\"600\" height=\"174\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
